    "description": "TAMDEF (Transantarctic Mountains GPS Deformation Network) project campaign GPS data collected at sites in southern Victoria Land, Antarctica, during the time periods November, 2003 - January, 2004; November, 2004 - January, 2005; and November 2005 - January, 2006; available from the UNAVCO Campaign Data archive.  These data add to the time series established during the previous project \"TAMDEF: Transantarctic Mountains Deformation Network, GPS Measurements of Rock and Ice Motions in South Victoria Land, Antarctica\" AMD ID:  TAMDEF, also available from the UNAVCO data archive.",
